 @bananya6020  With a card that uses 500W and a CPU that uses 250W, you are dumping 750W of heath in your room with those fans. And a few fans aren't going to push the heat of the case fast enough to not affect every part of the PC.
To deal with power spikes you need a 1000W PSU.
There is performance focused and there is silly.
